## Vulnerability Description
The applyOperation() function in fast-json-patch is vulnerable to prototype pollution via unsanitized JSON patch paths containing '__proto__', allowing attackers to modify Object.prototype and potentially achieve remote code execution or denial of service.

## Vulnerable API
applyOperation

