- Run this only in an isolated environment (e.g., `node --allow-natives-syntax poc.js`) where you can safely monitor CPU spikes or configure backtrack limits via custom VM flags if needed, as modern V8 defaults to time-based regex execution limits (~50ms) rather than step counts.
- This PoC is structured to propagate exceptions intentionally, allowing developers to observe the exact failure point in their target runtime or test harness.

